     2. each transaction reports the payment group it actually sits in — the
        payment-group context is cleared when the group closes, not carried into
        whatever comes next;
     3. only transaction rows carry an amount, so SUM(amount) equals the
        OrgnlCtrlSum the bank echoed back (25.99 + 19.99 + 186.02 = 232.00).
